@OrbitStudios Your post is dead on. Stats show that repub/cons are less educated. This is why 3 word slogans land.

Using words/ ideas that every day folks don’t understand, even if correct won’t be internalized. 

Ie Ppl feel unsafe- crime, car theft so talking about defunding police is dumb https://t.co/7mcP5WZx0n
